+### CAT-01 shared-label source review (17 October 2026)
+
+Ordinary subcategories require membership in the selected main collection before applying normalized category/subcategory comparisons. This prevents Women's Trousers and Women's Jacket from entering the corresponding Men's collections. Existing CAT-01 acceptance, tag routes, normalization and known gaps remain unchanged. Source review is separate from local browser results and deployed acceptance.
