+### CAT-01 shared-label regression (17 October 2026)
+
+Use the external framework's controlled category fixtures containing all 14 categories, including Women's/Men's Trousers and Jacket. Assert that /men/trousers and /men/jacket include only the matching Men's product, then rerun category membership, catalog filtering/sorting and storefront seed checks with unchanged expectations and zero retries. Intercepted GET fixtures prove frontend filtering only; database inventory, policies and deployed acceptance require separate evidence.
